<view class="page privacy-page">
  <view class="page-header">
    <view class="page-title">隐私说明</view>
    <view class="page-desc">问卷回答会默认保存在云端，方便你换设备后继续，也方便你随时修改或删除。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title section-title--first">信息处理</view>
  <view class="dl-list privacy-list">
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">01</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">保存的信息</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">包括问卷回答、回答时间、结果和修改记录。不填写联系方式也能完成答题。</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">02</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">怎么使用</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">只用于生成、保存和维护你的结果，不公开展示。当前结果仍在试用和调整，不是心理诊断。</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">03</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">{{privacy.retentionTitle}}</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">{{privacy.retention}}</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">04</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">{{privacy.rightsTitle}}</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">{{privacy.rights}}</view></view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">后续联系</view>
  <view class="dl-list privacy-list">
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">05</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">分开选择</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">不提供联系方式也能获得结果。一对一访谈、用不含身份信息的回答改进题目、线下活动邀请，这三件事分开选择，默认都不勾选。</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">06</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">联系方式单独保存</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">联系方式会和问卷回答分开保存。分析人员不会看到原始联系方式。</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">07</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">随时撤回或删除</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">你可以随时取消后续联系，也可以删除联系信息。删除问卷和结果时，本次答题相关的记录也会一起删除。</view></view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">{{privacy.operator}}</view>
  <view class="privacy-callout"><view class="dl-list-row__title">{{privacy.contact}}</view></view>
</view>
